      "decision_index": 38,
    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Opponent is at 12 life with no creatures and no untapped mana. GPT53C has Mistwalker (4/5), Bloodline Pretender (3/3), and Wight of Precinct Six (3/3) for 10 total power. Equipping Heirloom Blade (+3/+1) to any creature would bring total attack to 13, which is lethal. By passing, they only deal 10 damage and miss the kill.",
